# Paint/label changes retain solved placement; geometry changes resolve it.
assert title GRAPHSHELL H3 READY
act load-practice-projection
settle 2
assert snap projection-placement-solves == 1
click role:textbox Projection title
input-text Reused placement
settle 2
assert snap projection-placement-solves == 1
click role:tab Encoding
click role:textbox Label field
input-text catalog_id
settle 2
assert snap projection-placement-solves == 1
assert retained {"role":"button","label":"list card:2:","text":"chord:Major"}
click role:button Projection: order by tempo
settle 2
assert snap projection-placement-solves == 2
click role:button Projection: order by tempo
settle 2
assert snap projection-placement-solves == 2
assert snap projection-executable == true
capture projection_refresh
wait
log labels and appearance reuse geometry; changed arrangement solves once
